# Real-BVH edge with GOOD/NEUTRAL/BAD samples and a parameter-dependent target
# subspace. This is the paper Section 3.2 validation case, not the permissive
# runtime demo configuration.
node walk 1
registration walk LeftAnkle LeftAnkle,RightAnkle 3 1
example walk 0.0 ../BVH/walkCurve.bvh
example walk 0.5 ../BVH/walkMoreCurve.bvh
example walk 1.0 ../BVH/walkTightCurve.bvh
# D6 raw-sum thresholds keep classification selective: the widest-turn source
# sees GOOD, NEUTRAL, and BAD targets while tight-turn sources stay fully GOOD.
edge walk walk
edge_config walk walk 203 210 12 60 7
